           arm   vs closed   turns  monotone   |d| max
  ----------------------------------------------------
        A bare     0.00241       6     False    0.4178
          B +W     0.06289       4     False    0.3932
    C +imprint     0.32490       8     False    0.3372

  Arm A vs closed is the CORRECTNESS check on v37b: they are the same
  circuit, so they must agree to shot noise or the derivation is wrong.
  A->B is what the W gate's param-sys entanglement adds, B->C is what the
  energy imprint adds. Whichever step moves the numbers is the one the
  closed form was missing, and the one any explanation has to include.
